  - [x] Text Input\r\n  - [x] Mouse Event\r\n  - [x] Keyboard Event\r\n- Audio\r\n  - [x] Renderer\r\n  - [x] Capturer\r\n- DispayServer\r\n  - [x] Portrait Layout\r\n  - [x] Landscape Layout\r\n  - [x] Window Resize\r\n  - [x] IME Control\r\n  - [x] Clipboard\r\n- Scripts\r\n  - [x] GDScript\r\n- Network\r\n  - [x] TCP/IP stack\r\n  - [x] HTTP\r\n  - [x] HTTPS (TLS)\r\n- Export\r\n  - [x] Export Project \r\n  - [x] Run\r\n  - [x] Debug\r\n\r\n# Build export template\r\n1. Download [OpenHarmony SDK](https://gitee.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/en/release-notes/OpenHarmony-v5.1.0-release.md#acquiring-source-code-from-mirrors)\r\n2. Uncompress to any path. e.g. `C:/ohos-sdk-windows_linux-public/ohos-sdk/windows/{toolchains,previewer,js,ets,native}/`\r\n4. Run `scons.exe platform=openharmony target=template_debug generate_bundle=yes module_mono_enabled=no  OPENHARMONY_SDK_PATH=\"C:/ohos-sdk-windows_linux-public/ohos-sdk/windows\"`\r\n\r\n# Build app\r\n1. Download [Commandline Tools](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/download/command-line-tools-for-hmos)\r\n2. Uncompress to any path. e.g. `C:/command-line-tools`\r\n3. Set `C:/command-line-tools` to Editor Settings (Export > OpenHarmony > OpenHarmony Tool Path)\r\n4. Run export project in editor\r\n\r\n# Stable version for Godot 4.4.1\r\nhttps://github.com/kdada/godot/tree/openharmony","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_